        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Zane Grey, Clifford Smith, Roy Briant, J. Walter Ruben, John Stone\n- Works: Open Range, Dick Powell's Zane Grey Theater\n- Topics: Film adaptations, silent Western films, lost films\n\nFacts:\n- Open Range is a lost 1927 American Western silent film.\n- Open Range was directed by Clifford Smith.\n- Open Range was written by Roy Briant, Zane Grey, J. Walter Ruben, and John Stone.\n- Zane Grey's novels and short stories have been adapted into 112 films, two television episodes, and the television series Dick Powell's Zane Grey Theater.",
